stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PlanCandidate
    PlanCandidate --> PreAlphaDevelopment: CIO admits qualified plan
    PreAlphaDevelopment --> FeatureComplete: scoped stories and contracts pass
    FeatureComplete --> PreAlphaReleaseCandidate: exact image and evidence packet sealed
    PreAlphaReleaseCandidate --> PreAlphaDevelopment: failed QA security evaluation or UAT
    PreAlphaReleaseCandidate --> AwaitingAuthority: technical gates pass
    AwaitingAuthority --> PreAlphaReleased: release authority approves exact candidate
    AwaitingAuthority --> PreAlphaDeferred: release deferred or rejected
    PreAlphaReleased --> [*]
    PreAlphaDeferred --> [*]
